" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(57%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Not enough days in this city's record to split the year into four and still say anything defensible about each part. The split is shown only where it is supported.</p>\n"},"lat":6.245,"lon":-75.57151,"n":540,"n_cities":216,"name":"Medellin","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.23,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.12566037735849056,"n":53,"obs":0.1320754716981132,"sig":false},{"hi":0.3780000000000001,"lo":0.23,"mean":0.29254545454545455,"n":55,"obs":0.2545454545454545,"sig":false},{"hi":0.59,"lo":0.3780000000000001,"mean":0.4805660377358491,"n":53,"obs":0.39622641509433965,"sig":false},{"hi":0.7360000000000002,"lo":0.59,"mean":0.6639999999999999,"n":55,"obs":0.509090909090909,"sig":true},{"hi":0.86,"lo":0.7360000000000002,"mean":0.793653846153846,"n":52,"obs":0.5,"sig":true},{"hi":0.94,"lo":0.86,"mean":0.8884313725490198,"n":51,"obs":0.6470588235294118,"sig":true},{"hi":0.98,"lo":0.94,"mean":0.9546153846153846,"n":52,"obs":0.8269230769230769,"sig":true},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.98,"mean":0.9958579881656805,"n":169,"obs":0.8106508875739645,"sig":true}],"prcp_km":3.5,"provisional":false,"rank":177,"rank_hi":192.0,"rank_lo":128.975,"reliability":0.029404952186345756,"resolution":0.05780852454107242,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"medellin","station":"","timezone":"America/Bogota"}